{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 43, :comments ["<b>And it shall be sanctified by My glory.</b> In my opinion, because the Tent of Meeting encompasses everything — the Tabernacle and all its utensils, the ark and the three utensils — it is the place of meeting. And the tent was sanctified by My glory, for He dwells upon the cherubim."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:12.950028778Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}